                             "h":  "Welcome to SS2 Literature in English - First Term",
                             "p":  [
                                       "Welcome to SS2 Literature in English, First Term. This term is about poetry. You will read African poems by Okara, Soyinka, Osundare, Cheney-Coker, Afriyie-Vidza and Kamara, and non-African poems by Angelou, Byron, Heaney and Adcock, and learn how to explain their themes, tone and devices.",
                                       "Always read the poem itself in your anthology first. Where the lesson note could not be checked against the printed poem, or differs from other published readings, the unit says so plainly."
